  *                               int operand_role);
  * operand_role: 0=left(A), 1=right(B), 2=destination(C)
+ *
+ * The optional Metal MPP bounded-store-v1 extension appends scalar signed
+ * Int32/Int64 actual_rows, actual_columns. Only the prefix rectangle
+ * [0, actual_rows) x [0, actual_columns) is written; all other destination
+ * memory is untouched. Each extent must be between zero and its nominal
+ * extent. The FP32 destination pointer and positive leading stride must fit
+ * that rectangle (with transpose applied), and the pointer must remain valid
+ * even for an empty rectangle. Dynamic bounds and uniform complete-subgroup
+ * participation are caller preconditions. The source cooperative tensor's
+ * nominal shape/layout is unchanged. Loads keep the original 11-argument ABI.
  */
 TVM_DLL const Op& cooperative_tensor_store();
